                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Pros:\n- Good sense of humour\n- Fun platforming gameplay, similar to a retro PC game\n- Awesome soundtrack\n- Creative boss battles\n\nCons:\n- Graphical issues (There are some moments when the background and foreground blend into each other and make it less obvious what is and isn't ok to stand on)\n- The tube maze portions of the game are confusing and repetitive\n- sort of short\n\nOverall, The Final Specimen: Arrival is a hilarious and fun game that is well worth checking out. Don't let the MS Paint style graphics put you off from the game, it's actually really awesome!\n\nUPDATE 17/07/16:\nThe developer has since changed the boss patterns in hard mode. I feel like it adds more of a challenge and keeps the game fresh. Even the first boss has a new, more challenging pattern the player will have to learn.",
